1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:52,920
Did you hear ?

25
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:55,520
Someone is targeted by the Hundred Days Execution Order.

26
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,360
He also killed a group of Core Formation cultivators.

27
00:01:57,440 --> 00:02:00,440
I heard ! Even the Grand Elder was killed !

28
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:01,800
This is too sinister...

29
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,320
Is he Nascent Soul ?

30
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,640
This is... wait...

31
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,120
It's him !

32
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,520
Run ! Quick !

33
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:30,320
This fiend broke Xue Ming's formation

34
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,040
like it was nothing...

35
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,440
If we obey him,

36
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,360
we might be able to survive.

37
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,480
This person's strength is terrifying.

38
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,880
We must be very careful.

39
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:44,640
It seems becoming his disciple was the right choice.

40
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,000
If I follow him,

41
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,760
I'll be able to do as I please

42
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:49,320
in the outer Sea of Devils.

43
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,800
I need to establish a foothold in the Sea of Devils

44
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:56,440
and the Fighting Evil Sect is my best choice for that.

45
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:02,160
I used a bit too much of my Ji Realm earlier

46
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,640
but it's okay.

47
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,280
It should recover quickly

48
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,160
if I nourish it within my Sea of Consciousness.

49
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,800
He actually did it....

50
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:15,880
From now on,

51
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:19,280
I am the strongest person below Nascent Soul.

52
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,480
When I first met him,

53
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,920
I thought he was Sun Youcai.

54
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:29,000
I nearly caused a misunderstanding.

55
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:33,480
Had we really fought back then,

56
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:36,880
he would've slaughtered everyone present.

57
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:41,800
He wouldn't even have shown an ounce of mercy towards me.

58
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:43,880
You don't need to worry.

59
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,200
After I'm done with all this,

60
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:48,440
I'll take you back to the Burning Fire Alliance.

61
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:14,200
Fellow cultivator afflicted by the Hundred Days Execution Order,

62
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:17,080
Grand Elder Qian Kun provoked you

63
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,200
and killing him was justified.

64
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:22,600
You already killed dozens of our disciples.

65
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:24,080
However...

66
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:28,920
Do you truly think my Fighting Evil Sect is made of lambs to prey on ?

67
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:34,480
Formation !

68
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,840
10 000 cultivators in a formation...

69
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:41,560
The headquarters of the Fighting Evil Sect has 13 562 members

70
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,760
and they're all here !

71
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:47,000
The Great Dragon Formation actually exists !

72
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:57,360
Xie Donglai\NFighting Evil Sect Leader\NLate stage Core Formation

73
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:59,360
The Great Dragon Formation is the protection formation of the Fighting Evil Sect.

74
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:02,120
Unless you are a Nascent Soul cultivator,

75
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,520
it's impossible to break.

76
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,960
The formation isn't fully active yet.

77
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:11,640
My brother and I are Elders of a branch of the sect

78
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:15,640
Please let us negotiate with the Sect Leader for you.

79
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:16,760
Yes, yes !

80
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,480
We can still stop the formation now.

81
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,000
Once it's activated,

82
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,360
it will be too late.

83
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:25,840
Are you trying to pull a trick in front of Master ?

84
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,840
No need, just take care of Miss Li.

85
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,360
Understood.

86
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,600
Senior !

87
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,240
Be careful...

88
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:42,240
They need to set up this big formation

89
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,920
so it's the perfect time to attack.

90
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,280
Formation, activate !

91
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:28,600
His cultivation...

92
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:32,600
went from Late stage to Peak Late stage Core Formation !

93
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:33,880
Wait,

94
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,440
he's still breaking through !

95
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,400
This is...

96
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:50,440
Xie Donglai\NFighting Evil Sect Leader\NFalse Nascent Soul

97
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,800
False Nascent Soul realm...

98
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,200
False Nascent Soul

99
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,920
is below Early stage Nascent Soul.

100
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,720
But it's infinitely close to Nascent Soul.

101
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,440
The Fighting Evil Sect

102
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:03,520
doesn't accept traitors.

103
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,480
I thought he would win

104
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,000
but now the situation has changed...

105
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,200
He will lose !

106
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,520
He still has my Soul Blood...

107
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,080
If he dies,

108
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,840
I will die alongside him !

109
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,680
This Great Dragon Formation

110
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,760
must have some kind of weakness !

111
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,680
I have heard

112
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,200
the rumors about

113
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:26,120
what you did along the way.

114
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:29,040
No one below Nascent Soul can beat you.

115
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:33,520
But now, my cultivation is the equivalent of Nascent Soul !

116
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:36,920
Let's see if you can defeat me !

117
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:39,800
This formation...

118
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:49,960
The Myriad Blood Demon Formation...

119
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,000
I know that you broke

120
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:55,360
that traitor Xue Ming's Myriad Blood Demon Formation.

121
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,800
But the formation was only

122
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:01,240
a tenth of the power of the Great Dragon Formation !

123
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,360
You've gathered the spiritual energy

124
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,360
of 10 000 people on yourself.

125
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:08,000
You just temporarily increased your cultivation.

126
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,720
With my cultivation, it will only take an instant

127
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,400
to kill you !

128
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:30,000
Since I could break that Myriad Blood Demon Formation,

129
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:32,000
then I can break the Great Dragon Formation too !

130
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,160
You fool.

131
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,320
The might of a Nascent Soul

132
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:45,920
is not something a Junior like you can resist !

133
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,760
Since it operates like the Myriad Blood Demon Formation...

134
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,160
...he just needs to find its core !

135
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,400
Mere tricks !

136
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,160
The dragon's head !

137
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,600
Splendid !

138
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:15,360
It's been 100 years

139
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:18,240
since I have seen someone attack the formation !

140
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:23,560
It's time to eat !

141
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:26,760
A... a Nascent Soul cultivator !?

142
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:29,520
Wang Lin, you damn fiend !

143
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:39,360
Who gave you the audacity to challenge

144
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:40,840
our mighty sect

145
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:43,080
with such little strength ?

146
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,800
Mighty sect ?

147
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:47,160
You're too pretentious.

148
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:55,800
What ?

149
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,600
What the hell is this thing ?!

150
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,560
Grandpa Xu is the first demon of the world !

151
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,680
I must kill this monster today

152
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:10,840
in the name of the heavens !

153
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:32,680
Junior, you're no match for the teleportation

154
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:35,200
of the Nascent Soul level.

155
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:45,400
The formation... isn't broken !?

156
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,840
Did you think that our sect protection formation would break easily ?

157
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:04,000
If this formation is invincible,

158
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,920
then if enough people fuel it

159
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:08,480
it might even give Soul Formation level cultivation.

160
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:10,040
If that's true,

161
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:13,720
why didn't the Fighting Evil Sect invade South Dipper City ?

162
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:17,120
This formation must have a fatal weakness.

163
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,120
Could it be...

164
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:25,000
Neither you or your friends

165
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,680
will be able to escape !

166
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,320
Kill them !

167
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,280
Go ahead and try !

168
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,200
That old ghost Xie Donglai

169
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,400
is playing dirty !

170
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,080
That's good...

171
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:19,320
If she gets injured,

172
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:21,160
I probably won't live either.

173
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:34,520
It's not that easy to break my golden bowl !

174
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:02,200
The Fighting Evil Sect is lacking females.

175
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,400
From now on,

176
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:05,600
you belong to me !

177
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,560
You...

178
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,520
can die.

179
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:21,800
Senior !

180
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:24,720
Senior Brother, you're injured...

181
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:28,960
Master, fighting a Nascent Soul as a Core Formation

182
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,480
isn't possible.

183
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,280
We should retreat for now.

184
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:34,880
This Great Dragon Formation can't be broken by Core Formation cultivators.

185
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:37,080
We really should retreat.

186
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:43,320
Am I going to die here ?

187
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,640
Help ! Help me !

188
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,600
We won't retreat.

189
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:04,480
Be reasonable and give me your Golden Cores now.

190
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:07,200
If you don't, none of you will survive !

191
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,600
He can't hold on !

192
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:45,360
Are they the same strength now ?

193
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,920
Xie Donglai is retreating !

194
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,760
Could he already be tired ?

195
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:09,320
And now he's stronger...

196
00:16:18,040 --> 00:16:20,960
This is the end of this battle !

197
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,280
No !

198
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:24,920
One last test.

199
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:35,840
Just as I thought.

200
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:44,680
Senior !

201
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:44,680
Master !

202
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:46,120
Are you alright ?

203
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:50,840
I found the way to beat the Great Dragon Formation.

204
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:20,440
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

205
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:23,320
I will let the world refine my soul.

206
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:26,200
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

207
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:29,080
I will fight.

208
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:31,960
I'll break through the abyss of despair

209
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:34,840
to finally learn who I really am.

210
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:37,720
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

211
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:40,600
I embrace this obsession.

212
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:43,800
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

213
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:46,560
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

214
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:49,320
